{"meta":{"format_version":"4.5","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"fish_giant_catfish","model_identifier":"catfish","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"Survive and Conquer \u2014 CATFISH\n============================================================\nlarge catfish: muddy olive-brown, broad flat head, whiskers, rounded caudal\n\nSCALE\n  1 unit = 2.8125 cm\n  length: 46.20 u = 129.94 cm = 1.299 m\n  body depth (excl. fins): 11.00 u = 30.9 cm  (half-ht param 5.50)\n  body width: 8.60 u = 24.2 cm\n  hit box (W x H x D): 10.5 x 12.0 x 47.0 u\n\nORIGIN\n  Mid-body centre at (0,0,0). Facing -Z (head toward -Z, tail +Z).\n  Belly sits below y=0 by ~half body height; game places the unit at swim depth.\n  Creature right = +X.\n\nCUBES: 46   BONES: 19\n  chain: root > body_front > body_mid > body_rear > tail > caudal\n  fins: dorsal, anal, pectoral_r/l, pelvic_r/l, barbels (max/chin/nasal x2)\n\nANIMATIONS\n  idle: 2.800 s, loop=loop\n  swim: 1.200 s, loop=loop\n  swim designed speed: 0.80 m/s = 28.4 u/s (in-place cycle; game translates the root)\n  idle: gentle fin scull + slow body sway, 2.80 s loop\n\nNo attack / death / injured clips (commission: idle + swim only).\n\n"},"resolution":{"width":256,"height":256},"elements":[{"name":"snout","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-3.311,-1.5125,-23.1],"to":[3.311,1.6638,-20.328],"autouv":0,"color":0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,-15.9852],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[183.0,27.0,190.0,30.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[190.0,27.0,193.0,30.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[193.0,27.0,200.0,30.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[180.0,27.0,183.0,30.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[183.0,24.0,190.0,27.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[190.0,24.0,197.0,27.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"76c98852-7a1a-5fc2-889f-1ff967381aa2"},{"name":"head","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"lock